      "finding": null,
      "explanation": "There is a description-behavior mismatch: the skill is positioned broadly for many PDF operations and is likely triggered for any .pdf-related request, but the content also enumerates highly sensitive capabilities (OCR/searchable extraction, image extraction, encryption/decryption, watermarking, merges/splits). This increases the chance the agent performs operations the user did not intend, which can lead to privacy violations or unauthorized document handling.",
      "remediation": "Tighten the trigger conditions and split into narrower skills (e.g., \u201cpdf-text-extraction\u201d, \u201cpdf-merge/split\u201d, \u201cpdf-encryption\u201d, \u201cpdf-ocr\u201d). For each narrow skill, document exact inputs/outputs and require the user to confirm sensitive operations (OCR/image extraction/encryption/decryption) before execution.",
      "code_snippet": null,
      "intent": null,
      "tags": [
        "ASI02",
        "AML.T0080"
      ]
    },
    {
