      },
      "finding": null,
      "explanation": "The documentation assumes availability of external command-line tools (qpdf/pdftotext/pdfimages/pdftk) and OCR dependencies (Tesseract) but does not describe how execution is sandboxed, how arguments are validated, or what environment constraints apply. In agent contexts, missing execution constraints can increase the risk of command injection via untrusted filenames/paths or unintended tool execution behavior.",
      "remediation": "Document and enforce environment assumptions: run external tools with parameterized arguments (no shell), validate/whitelist input paths, and ensure tools execute in a sandbox with restricted filesystem/network access. Add explicit guidance for handling untrusted PDFs safely (resource limits/timeouts, file size caps).",
      "code_snippet": null,
