      "finding": null,
      "explanation": "The skill description omits warnings about sensitive data handling. PDF OCR and text/table extraction can reveal personal or confidential information, and watermarking/merging can spread that data across outputs. Lack of privacy/desensitization guidance increases the likelihood of misuse or accidental leakage.",
      "remediation": "Add prominent privacy/security warnings: advise users to obtain consent for OCR/extraction, note that OCR/text extraction may expose sensitive content, and recommend redaction where appropriate. In the agent flow, require confirmation before OCR/image extraction and before writing extracted data to persistent outputs.",
