      "finding": null,
      "explanation": "The instructions describe processing PDFs that may contain personally identifiable information, credentials, or other sensitive data, but they do not include any user-facing privacy/data-sensitivity warning or handling guidance. This omission can lead users to upload or process sensitive documents without understanding the risks (e.g., unintended disclosure to tools/services, logging, or downstream sharing).",
      "remediation": "Add clear user-facing guidance near the beginning of the skill: (1) warn that PDFs may contain sensitive personal or confidential data; (2) advise users to remove/redact sensitive content when possible; (3) disclose that the workflow may convert documents to images and extract text/fields, increasing exposure surface; (4) provide instructions for using trusted/local environments and not sharing documents externally; (5) include a brief note on retention/logging if applicable in the execution environment.",
      "code_snippet": null,
      "intent": null,
      "tags": []
